DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  \nDear Ellie\,\n\n \n\n\n\nThis
  is to confirm that you have registered for the following Consent and Healt
 hy Relationship (CHR) virtual instructor-led training session:\n\n\n\n\n\n\
 n\n\nTraining Title:\nCHR Part 3: Trojans Act Now \n\n\nTraining Type:\n\nS
 ession\n\n\n\n\nSession Number:\n\n5PM TAN 219\n\n\n\nDate(s):\n\n2/3/2026 
 to 2/3/2026\n\n\n\nTime(s):\n\n5:00 PM to 7:00 PM\n\n\n\nSession Duration:\
 n\n2 Hours 0 Minutes\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\nThis module is required  for under
 graduates in fifth/sixth semester and centers on how to be a prosocial  ups
 tander and promote culture change. Incompletion  of your assigned module by
  February  27th\, 2026 will result in a registration hold beginning Summer 
 2026 registration. Registration holds are released immediately  following s
 ession completion\, however\, completion status in MyUSC could be  delayed 
 up to 24 hours.  In other words\,  you will not be able to register for cla
 sses right after completing your  training.\n\n\n\nYou must click the link 
 below 5 minutes before the session start time to launch and attend the modu
 le:\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nLAUNCH YOUR VIRTUAL SESSION(https://shibboleth.usc.edu/
 idp/profile/SAML2/Unsolicited/SSO?providerId=https://trojanlearn.csod.com/s
 hibboleth&shire=https://trojanlearn.csod.com/samldefault.aspx&target=%252fD
