 his is to confirm that you have registered for the following Consent and He
 althy Relationship (CHR) virtual instructor-led training session:\n\n\n\n\n
 \n\n\n\nTraining Title:\nCHR Part 1: Trojans Respect Consent \n\n\nTraining
  Type:\n\nSession\n\n\n\nSession Number:\n\n5PM TRC 184\n\n\n\nDate(s):\n\n
 12/4/2025 to 12/4/2025\n\n\n\nTime(s):\n\n5:00 PM to 7:00 PM\n\n\n\nSession
  Duration:\n\n2 Hours 0 Minutes\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\nThis module is required
  for undergraduates in their first/second semester and centers on understan
 ding bodily autonomy\, identifying how power impacts consent\, and emphasiz
 es respectful communication between sexual partners. Incompletion of your a
 ssigned module by February 27th\, 2026 will result in a registration hold b
 eginning Summer 2026 registration. Registration holds are released immediat
 ely following session completion\, however\, completion status in MyUSC cou
 ld be delayed up to 24 hours.  In other words\, you will not be able to reg
 ister for classes right after completing your training.\n\n\n\nYou must cli
 ck the link below 5 minutes before the session start time to launch and att
 end the module:\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nLAUNCH YOUR VIRTUAL SESSION(https://shibbol
 eth.usc.edu/idp/profile/SAML2/Unsolicited/SSO?providerId=https://trojanlear
 n.csod.com/shibboleth&shire=https://trojanlearn.csod.com/samldefault.aspx&t
 arget=%252fDeepLink%252fProcessRedirect.aspx%253fmodule%253dlaunchvilttrain
 ing%2526src%253demail%2526objectId%253d619f778a-fff2-41c1-925b-5934782d8491
 %2526userId%253d%2525255e%2525255e%2525255enFRZMe1zComAOWt3RMF%2525252fVg%2
 525253d%2525253d)\n\n\n\n\n\nPlease note that you will need to be actively 
 participating to complete your requirement. To ensure that we can have the 
 most optimal session\, we ask the following:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPlease be sure 
 to update your zoom account to the most up-to-date version.\nPlease launch 
 the session with a laptop or a computer. If you do not have access to a lap
 top or a desktop\, please email us at sconsent@usc.edu(mailto:sconsent@usc.
 edu) to let us know and we can assist with access to a computer in our offi
 ce.\nPlease note that you will be asked to turn your camera on and to parti
 cipate throughout the session if you are at capacity. Please make sure that
  you are in a quiet\, private location where you are able to participate. \
 nDo not show up to the session late or leave early. Your attention is requi
 red for the full 2 hours.  Signing up for a session does not equal completi
 on. Students must actively participate in the live remote session to comple
 te the requirement.\n\n\nIndividuals with disabilities who need accommodati
 ons to attend this event may complete the Accommodation Request Form(https:
 //usc.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_3f1IF7k6z7NgudU). It is requested that indi
 viduals requiring accommodations or auxiliary aids such as sign language in
 terpreters and alternative format materials notify us at least ten days pri
 or to the event. Every reasonable effort will be made to provide reasonable
  accommodations in an effective and timely manner.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThank you\,
 \n\n\n \n\n\nUSC Student Health\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nQuestions about this 
 training?\n\n    \nPlease contact: USC Student Requirements at required@usc
 .edu(mailto:required@usc.edu).\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nThis email was generated b
 y Trojan Learn\, USC's centralized portal for learning.  Direct technical q
 uestions about TrojanLearn to USC Student Requirements at required@usc.edu(
 mailto:required@usc.edu). Please do not reply to this email. \n\n  \n\n\n\n
  CSOD SYSTEM ID:  5472153\n
