ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;CN=El
 lie Lin-Stevens;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:elinstev@usc.edu
CREATED:20260208T204208Z
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  \nDear Ellie\,\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nT
 his is to confirm that you have registered for the following Consent and He
 althy Relationship (CHR) virtual instructor-led training session:\n\n\n\n\n
 \n\n\n\nTraining Title:\nCHR Part 1: Trojans Respect Consent \n\n\nTraining
  Type:\n\nSession\n\n\n\nSession Number:\n\n5:30PM TRC 162\n\n\n\nDate(s):\
 n\n11/20/2025 to 11/20/2025\n\n\n\nTime(s):\n\n5:30 PM to 7:30 PM\n\n\n\nSe
 ssion Duration:\n\n2 Hours 0 Minutes\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\nThis module is req
 uired for undergraduates in their first/second semester and centers on unde
 rstanding bodily autonomy\, identifying how power impacts consent\, and emp
 hasizes respectful communication between sexual partners. Incompletion of y
 our assigned module by February 27th\, 2026 will result in a registration h
 old beginning Summer 2026 registration. Registration holds are released imm
 ediately following session completion\, however\, completion status in MyUS
 C could be delayed up to 24 hours.  In other words\, you will not be able t
 o register for classes right after completing your training.\n\n\n\nYou mus
 t click the link below 5 minutes before the session start time to launch an
 d attend the module:\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nLAUNCH YOUR VIRTUAL SESSION(https://sh
 ibboleth.usc.edu/idp/profile/SAML2/Unsolicited/SSO?providerId=https://troja
 nlearn.csod.com/shibboleth&shire=https://trojanlearn.csod.com/samldefault.a
 spx&target=%252fDeepLink%252fProcessRedirect.aspx%253fmodule%253dlaunchvilt
 training%2526src%253demail%2526objectId%253d3576de76-2b90-43bd-b9fd-74c5e37
 eebfe%2526userId%253d%2525255e%2525255e%2525255enFRZMe1zComAOWt3RMF%2525252
 fVg%2525253d%2525253d)\n\n\n\n\n\nPlease note that you will need to be acti
 vely participating to complete your requirement. To ensure that we can have
  the most optimal session\, we ask the following:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPlease be 
 sure to update your zoom account to the most up-to-date version.\nPlease la
 unch the session with a laptop or a computer. If you do not have access to 
 a laptop or a desktop\, please email us at sconsent@usc.edu(mailto:sconsent
 @usc.edu) to let us know and we can assist with access to a computer in our
  office.\nPlease note that you will be asked to turn your camera on and to 
 participate throughout the session if you are at capacity. Please make sure
  that you are in a quiet\, private location where you are able to participa
 te. \nDo not show up to the session late or leave early. Your attention is 
 required for the full 2 hours.  Signing up for a session does not equal com
 pletion. Students must actively participate in the live remote session to c
 omplete the requirement.\n\n\nIndividuals with disabilities who need accomm
 odations to attend this event may complete the Accommodation Request Form(h
 ttps://usc.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_3f1IF7k6z7NgudU). It is requested that
  individuals requiring accommodations or auxiliary aids such as sign langua
 ge interpreters and alternative format materials notify us at least ten day
 s prior to the event. Every reasonable effort will be made to provide reaso
 nable accommodations in an effective and timely manner.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThank 
 you\,\n\n\n \n\n\nUSC Student Health\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nQuestions about 
 this training?\n\n    \nPlease contact: USC Student Requirements at require
 d@usc.edu(mailto:required@usc.edu).\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nThis email was genera
 ted by Trojan Learn\, USC's centralized portal for learning.  Direct techni
 cal questions about TrojanLearn to USC Student Requirements at required@usc
 .edu(mailto:required@usc.edu). Please do not reply to this email. \n\n  \n\
 n\n\n CSOD SYSTEM ID:  5237778\n
