DESCRIPTION:Get up-to-date information at: https://luma.com/event/evt-WXQSQ
 EB9RwB39GY?pk=g-XV21rhPbu8c0wuu\n\nAddress:\nRonald Tutor Campus Center\nRi
 ptide will be hosted at the Ronald Tutor Campus Center at the Forum (TCC 45
 0)! Look out for further instructions on our Instagram @riptidesummit.\nLos
  Angeles\, California\nUnited States\n\nIntroducing Riptide 2025 🌊\nRiptid
 e is a design + tech conference hosted by Innovative Design at USC\, open t
 o students from all campuses. It’s a space for creative exploration\, meani
 ngful connection\, and conversations at the edge of emerging tech and desig
 n.\nThis year’s conference will be held on November 23\, 2025 from 12–3 PM 
 at the TCC Forum.\nFollow @riptidesummit to stay updated on our speakers\, 
